0 // The shadow library gives only the four corner sockets underneath (s\79387s02.dat), at the bottom of the
0 // rounded corner feet (16 LDU down). Between the feet each edge is only plate-thick: its underside is 8 LDU
0 // up, a recess a plate fits into, so the eight edge sockets sit there (4 LDU deep, like a plate's).
0 !LDCAD SNAP_CYL [gender=F] [caps=one] [secs=R 6 4] [pos=-10 8 -30]
0 !LDCAD SNAP_CYL [gender=F] [caps=one] [secs=R 6 4] [pos=10 8 -30]
0 !LDCAD SNAP_CYL [gender=F] [caps=one] [secs=R 6 4] [pos=-10 8 30]
0 !LDCAD SNAP_CYL [gender=F] [caps=one] [secs=R 6 4] [pos=10 8 30]
0 !LDCAD SNAP_CYL [gender=F] [caps=one] [secs=R 6 4] [pos=-30 8 -10]
0 !LDCAD SNAP_CYL [gender=F] [caps=one] [secs=R 6 4] [pos=-30 8 10]
0 !LDCAD SNAP_CYL [gender=F] [caps=one] [secs=R 6 4] [pos=30 8 -10]
0 !LDCAD SNAP_CYL [gender=F] [caps=one] [secs=R 6 4] [pos=30 8 10]
